Announcement audio (audio/**/*.wav)
-----------------------------------
The announcement clips were synthesized with Piper (https://github.com/OHF-Voice/piper1-gpl)
using the "en_US-ljspeech-high" voice from https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices
(en/en_US/ljspeech/high).

That voice was trained from scratch on the LJ Speech Dataset
(https://keithito.com/LJ-Speech-Dataset/), which is in the public domain, as
stated in the voice's MODEL_CARD. Piper itself was only used to render the
clips; no Piper code is included in this package.

The clips can be regenerated with scripts/make-clips.js.
